SCOPE NOTE

This licence covers everything in this repository: the Power BI template
(powerbi/SaaS_Growth_Unit_Economics.pbit), the DAX measure export, the report
theme, all documentation, the page images, and the synthetic dataset in data/.

The dataset is entirely synthetic — generated by a seeded simulation. It
contains no real customers, companies, individuals or commercial figures, and
no third-party data. No font binary, icon set or third-party component is
redistributed here.
